  "summary": "On May 20-21, 2026, the SEC said it is seeking public feedback on prediction market ETFs and other novel ETFs, while Polymarket filed to list U.S. parlays/combinatorial outcome contracts no earlier than May 21. Together, the developments signal growing institutionalization of prediction markets and renewed scrutiny over how event contracts should be regulated.",
