    },
    {
      "fact": "Under Polymarket's filing, every leg in the parlay must resolve successfully for the contract to pay $1.00; if any single leg fails, the contract resolves to $0.00.",
      "source": "CoinDesk"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Cointelegraph reported that Bitwise filed in February for PredictionShares ETFs tracking U.S. election results, and Roundhill Investments and GraniteShares also filed for prediction market ETFs.",
